DRAIN MANA

Shadow Wraith companion ability.

Activation chance: 20 percent per successful strike.
Internal cooldown: 3 seconds.

Drains 10 percent of enemy maximum mana,
limited to the enemy's available mana.

Restores half to the owner and half to the companion.
The owner receives the extra point on an odd split.
Restoration cannot exceed maximum mana.

Protected permanent monsters are unaffected.
